{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object near, grab it and check properties. Do specific task if done. If not, move to object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToObject    />\"",
